                  <body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/"><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Instructions:<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in">You are requesting a final term extension to the State University Grant. Please submit the following:</p><ol style="letter-spacing:0in"><li style="font-size:11pt">State University Grant Appeal Form</li><li style="font-size:11pt">Documentation of final term (Written confirmation or the equivalent from a Graduation Specialist or Major Advisor)</li></ol><p style="font-size:13pt;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0in"><br/></p><p style="font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline;letter-spacing:0in">Appeal Process:<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span></p><p style="font-size:11pt;letter-spacing:0in">Appeals are reviewed by the Office of Financial Aid. Please allow<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">2-3 weeks</span> for your appeal to be reviewed. We will e-mail the decision to your campus e-mail address. If approved, we will extend the State University Grant for<span style="xfa-spacerun:yes"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold;text-decoration:underline">one</span> final term. If you do not graduate after the term your appeal was granted you will not be eligible to appeal again.</p></body>
